   "text": "Aadhaar Secure QR, RSA-2048 signed\n  by UIDAI (test key in demo)\nsnarkjs Groth16 · ~1M constraints\n  (~1.5–4 min, made once)\nsignal = wallet · seed = app id\nreveals only: age ≥ 18, state",
