   "width": 308.88,
   "height": 226.875,
   "text": "FHIR R4 Bundle: Condition(ICD-10),\n  Procedure, Meds, LOINC, Claim\nk  = random AES-256 key\nct = AES-256-GCM(k, bundle)\nrecordHash = keccak(tag‖k‖ct) mod p\nN  = Poseidon2(D_NUL, salt,\n       recordHash, procedure)\nR  = addr(keccak(hospitalSecret, N))\npayout = (Σbill − ded)·(1 − copay)\ndigest = Poseidon2(D_CONSENT, N,\n       payout, R, date, C)",
   "originalText": "FHIR R4 Bundle: Condition(ICD-10),\n  Procedure, Meds, LOINC, Claim\nk  = random AES-256 key\nct = AES-256-GCM(k, bundle)\nrecordHash = keccak(tag‖k‖ct) mod p\nN  = Poseidon2(D_NUL, salt,\n       recordHash, procedure)\nR  = addr(keccak(hospitalSecret, N))\npayout = (Σbill − ded)·(1 − copay)\ndigest = Poseidon2(D_CONSENT, N,\n       payout, R, date, C)",
