   "seed": 1111,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7784,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1710,
   "y": 2137,
   "width": 360.36,
   "height": 247.5,
   "text": "k_e = AES key of the emergency card\nShamir split over GF(256): 3 shares, t = 2\nshare_i = ECIES-wrapped to guardian_i\n  → BreakGlass.setGuardians (on-chain)\nresponder: request(patient, pubkey,\n  reason, id)  ← from the lock-screen QR\nguardian: unwrap own share → re-wrap\n  to responder → approve(id, share)\n2 approvals → unlocked for 24 h\nresponder: combine 2 shares → k_e →\n  decrypt card → logView (on-chain)\n1 share alone reveals nothing",
   "originalText": "k_e = AES key of the emergency card\nShamir split over GF(256): 3 shares, t = 2\nshare_i = ECIES-wrapped to guardian_i\n  → BreakGlass.setGuardians (on-chain)\nresponder: request(patient, pubkey,\n  reason, id)  ← from the lock-screen QR\nguardian: unwrap own share → re-wrap\n  to responder → approve(id, share)\n2 approvals → unlocked for 24 h\nresponder: combine 2 shares → k_e →\n  decrypt card → logView (on-chain)\n1 share alone reveals nothing",
   "fontSize": 16.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
