   "width": 351.78000000000003,
   "height": 268.125,
   "text": "hash: Poseidon2 over BN254, domain\n  tags D_HOSP, D_POL, D_NUL, D_CONSENT…\nsignatures/ECDH: secp256k1\nsymmetric: AES-256-GCM\nproofs: UltraHonk (claims, no trusted\n  setup) · Groth16 (Anon Aadhaar)\nstorage: IPFS CIDv1 (sha2-256)\ndata: HL7 FHIR R4 · ICD-10-CM · LOINC\nregistries: ABDM HFR / NMC → keccak\n  attestation on-chain (snapshot or live)\noffline: CRS mirror + bundled fonts\nchain: Anvil now · Base Sepolia script\ntests: 31 forge · 11 sdk · 14/14 attacks",
   "originalText": "hash: Poseidon2 over BN254, domain\n  tags D_HOSP, D_POL, D_NUL, D_CONSENT…\nsignatures/ECDH: secp256k1\nsymmetric: AES-256-GCM\nproofs: UltraHonk (claims, no trusted\n  setup) · Groth16 (Anon Aadhaar)\nstorage: IPFS CIDv1 (sha2-256)\ndata: HL7 FHIR R4 · ICD-10-CM · LOINC\nregistries: ABDM HFR / NMC → keccak\n  attestation on-chain (snapshot or live)\noffline: CRS mirror + bundled fonts\nchain: Anvil now · Base Sepolia script\ntests: 31 forge · 11 sdk · 14/14 attacks",
